&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>Prairie Landscape Inventory (PLI) - Mixed Grassland Accuracy</span> raster file, which depicts the estimated level of accuracy for this classification.</div></div>"
